`person: injured` MEANS
    `The person` WITH
        `was injured as a direct result of the act`                                                         IS TRUE
        `was injured trying to prevent the act, help or rescue a person, or arrest the offender`            IS FALSE
        `was injured as a direct result of witnessing the act`                                              IS FALSE
        `was injured as a direct result of subsequently becoming aware of the act`                          IS FALSE
        `is the parent or guardian of the primary victim`                                                   IS FALSE
        `the primary victim was under 18 at the time of the act`                                            IS FALSE
        `committed the act`                                                                                 IS FALSE
        `is a parent, step-parent or guardian caring for a child who is a primary victim`                   IS FALSE
        `a person died as a result of the act`                                                              IS FALSE
        `relationship to the person who died`                                                               IS `no family relationship`
        `had cohabited with the person who died for at least 2 years`                                       IS FALSE
        `the person who died is the alleged offender`                                                       IS FALSE
        `is also a member of the immediate family of another person who died as a result of the road crime` IS FALSE
        `the victim has died`                                                                               IS FALSE
        `has been paid, is entitled to, or has applied for court compensation under Part 6`                 IS FALSE
        `was engaged in behaviour constituting an offence when the act occurred`                            IS FALSE
        `was imprisoned as a convicted inmate when the act occurred`                                        IS FALSE
        `the Commissioner is satisfied that special circumstances justify an exception`                     IS FALSE

